                 "data": {},
                 "content": [
                  {
                   "data": {},
                   "marks": [],
                   "value": "All models have a troop type. These, along with the type of formation units of such models adopt, determine how they function throughout the rules. Troop types were explained in ",
                   "nodeType": "text"
                  },
                  {
                   "data": {
                    "target": {
